      ],
      "tagline": "Born curious, slightly obsessive about details, and chronically out the door.",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "6a20384492b97a2502633f1b",
          "content": "I'm a frontend developer based in Brussels. I build for the web because the medium is {warm:generous} — you can ship something on a Tuesday and have a stranger tell you it changed their afternoon."
        },
        {
          "id": "6a20384492b97a2502633f1c",
          "content": "Right now I'm deepening into design systems, motion, and the messy edges of real user data. I want to be a {blue:full-stack craftsperson} — backend, infra, all of it — but I'm taking it one honest layer at a time."
        },
        {
          "id": "6a20384492b97a2502633f1d",
          "content": "When I'm not at a screen, I'm probably on two wheels, lost in a paperback, or climbing a fence I shouldn't be climbing to photograph the rust on the other side."
        }
      ],
